  sysNote: 'Share of answers naming the company asked about. Gemini answered only 17 times for security and cloud; that value is not reliable (—).',
  vglKicker: 'Comparison', vglH2: 'Of all industries, the one that builds the technology',
  vglLead: 'To compare with the KI-Blindtest Mittelstand 2026, the IT figures are counted the same way: ChatGPT and Google only, per question. IT does worse — almost entirely because of system integrators and IT service providers.',
  vglHead: ['Metric', 'Mittelstand (449)', 'IT total (100)', 'Software (40)', 'Integrator/IT services (40)', 'Security/cloud (20)'],
  vglNote: 'Only partly comparable: in the Mittelstand study (June/July 2026) ChatGPT answered without web search and Google AI Overviews were measured; here all systems search the web and Google AI Mode was measured. The direction is robust; read the gap as an order of magnitude only.',
  vglLink: 'Go to the AI Blind Test 2026 (Mittelstand) →',
  wbKicker: 'Who gets recommended', wbH2: 'Usually a mid-sized firm, not a corporation',
  wbLead: `Who the AI names instead of the company: share of competitors named, by size, based on ${nm(T.wettbewerberNennungen)} mentions. A corporation has more than 1,000 employees or belongs to a group.`,
  wbLegend: ['Mid-sized firms', 'Corporations'],
  wbAll: 'All 100 companies',
  qKicker: 'Sources', qH2: 'What the AI relies on',
  qLead: `Share of all ${nm(T.quellenangaben)} source citations from ${nm(T.antwortenMitQuellen)} answers with sources (${nm(T.quellenWebsites)} different websites). Rounded.`,
  qRund: 'around',
  qPointe: 'Seven in ten sources are vendor websites — but only in one answer in ten is it the website of the company asked about. In 29% of answers with sources, the website of a named competitor serves as evidence, often its guide or best-of list. Comparison portals appear in at least one answer in three.',
  fKicker: 'From the measurement', fH2: 'Two cases — anonymised',
  fLead: 'Snapshots from 5 November 2026. Company and competitor names are omitted for fairness.',
  faelle: [
    { k: 'System integrator · question from a head of IT', s: '2 questions · 5 AI systems · 10 answers', d: 'In nine of ten answers the same mid-sized system integrator is recommended, the two best-known corporations together in three. All five systems cite a page of this integrator that answers exactly this question: target group, size, price per workstation, response time, region, questions and answers.' },
    { k: 'Software · question about GDPR-compliant email marketing software', s: '1 question · 5 AI systems · 5 answers', d: 'All five answers pick up the data protection argument: server location, data processing agreement, double opt-in. And all five name the same vendor, which has its own concrete page on exactly this point. Several systems use exactly that page as evidence.' },
  ],
  gKicker: 'To take away', gH2: 'Charts to download',
  gLead: 'The four key charts as PNG (3,200 px wide) and as PDF for print — labelled in German. Free to use with the source line shown in each chart.',
  grafiken: [
    ['Grafik-1_Nennung-je-Segment', 'Mentions by segment'],
    ['Grafik-2_Vergleich-Mittelstand', 'Comparison with the Mittelstand'],
    ['Grafik-3_Konzern-oder-Mittelstaendler', 'Corporation or mid-sized firm'],
    ['Grafik-4_Quellenarten', 'What the AI relies on'],
  ],
  gAlt: 'Bar chart: software vendors are named in 33% of AI answers, IT security and cloud providers in 25%, system integrators and IT service providers in 6%.',
  dcKicker: 'The test for your company', dcH2: 'And your company — on the shortlist?',
  dcLead: 'The same method, applied to your company: your eight buyer questions, the real AI answers, your competitors. Enter your domain.',
  dcLabel: 'Your company domain', dcPh: 'your-company.com', dcBtn: 'Check visibility',
  dcKnown: ['A full visibility analysis is already available for ', '.'], dcKnownBtn: 'Go to your analysis →',
  dcResp: ['Thank you — we will check ', ' using the method of this analysis. We discuss the results in 30 minutes, without sales pressure.'], dcRespBtn: 'Request the analysis (30-min call) →',
  dcFine: 'Free · no registration for the check · results are not published.',
  wKicker: 'Live webinar', wH2: 'The results live — on 24 November',
  wLead: 'On Tuesday, 24 November 2026, 11:00–12:00 CET, we present the study together with Norbert Schuster: how buying centres choose software and IT partners, and why AI writes the shortlist. For software vendors, system integrators and IT service providers. Held in German.',
  wRole: 'Strategy consultant, author & speaker · author of a Haufe standard work on digitalisation in marketing and sales',
  wBtn: 'Register free →', wFine: 'Recording and guide for everyone registered (in German)',
  mKicker: 'Transparency', mH2: 'Methodology',
  lKicker: 'Honesty before effect', lH2: 'Limitations', lLead: 'An analysis is only as credible as the limits it names itself.',
  zH2: 'How to cite this analysis',
  zLead: 'The aggregated figures may be quoted freely with attribution — in articles, talks, books and presentations. Please always state the base (share of answers or number of companies) and note that this is not a random sample.',
  zKern: 'Key statements to quote', zKernSub: 'Each statement stands on its own and has its own link (symbol #).', zLinkSr: ' Link to statement ',
  zVor: 'Suggested citation', zCopy: 'Copy', zCopied: 'Copied ✓',
  zData: 'Data and versions', zCsv: 'Key figures as CSV ↓', zCsvD: 'all aggregated values with unit — for checking and your own charts', zMd: 'Text version (Markdown) →', zMdD: 'the whole analysis as plain text, also for AI assistants',
  zMail: 'Questions on the method:', zPub: 'Publisher details for reference lists:', zPubLink: 'Facts about CodaAI', zPubHref: L('/en/facts/'),
  faqH2: 'FAQ',
  faq: [
    { q: 'Is the AI Blind Test B2B Tech 2026 representative of the IT industry?', a: 'No, and we do not claim it is. The 100 companies come from association, label and partner directories and have 20 to 1,000 employees. The results hold for these companies. The direction matches the KI-Blindtest Mittelstand 2026 with 449 companies.' },
    { q: 'Why were the AI systems queried with web search?', a: 'Because that is how buyers use them: ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity and Google AI Mode usually search the web before answering purchase questions. This also shows which sources the systems rely on.' },
    { q: 'Why do system integrators and IT service providers do so badly?', a: 'The data shows a correlation: their websites are a source in only 3% of answers, compared with 15% for software vendors. Where an integrator has a page that answers the concrete customer question, it gets recommended — even against corporations. The measurement does not prove a cause in the strict sense.' },
    { q: 'Are the names of the companies examined published?', a: 'No. Only aggregated figures are published. Individual results are company-specific and go only to the company concerned if it asks for an analysis.' },
    { q: 'Can I have the visibility of my IT company checked?', a: 'Yes. Using the same method we create an analysis for your company — with your buyer questions, the real AI answers and the competitors named instead of you. Enter your domain on this page.' },
  ],
  ctaH2: '30 minutes, one clear finding.',
  ctaLead: 'No sales pitch: we show you whether AI puts your company on the shortlist — and the two or three levers that work fastest for you.',
  ctaBtn: 'Book a free intro call →',
};

const [reportSchema, datasetSchema] = techSchemas(lang, C.schemaDesc);
const faqSchema = JSON.stringify({
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: C.faq.map((f) => ({ '@type': 'Question', name: f.q, acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.a } })),
});
const vgl = (v: number) => pc0(v);
---

<Layout lang={lang} title={C.title} description={C.description} jsonLd={[reportSchema, datasetSchema, faqSchema]} mdVariant={TECH_MD[lang]}>
  <Navbar lang={lang} />
  <main id="main-content" class="pt-24 lg:pt-28">

    <!-- ── Hero ── -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-border bg-background">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
        <Breadcrumb items={C.crumbs} class="mb-8" />
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cta-accessible">{C.kicker}</p>
          <h1 class="cai-h1 cai-kipp text-foreground">
            <span class="k1 block">{C.h1a}</span>
            <span class="k2 block">{C.h1b}</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground lg:text-xl">{C.lead}</p>
        </div>
        <dl class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-border sm:grid-cols-3">
          {C.band.map((b, i) => (
            <div class="bg-card px-8 py-8 text-center">
              <dd class="text-4xl font-bold tabular-nums tracking-tight text-foreground lg:text-5xl" data-count={b.n}>{nm(b.n)}</dd>
              <dt class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground"><span class="block">{b.a}</span><span class="block">{b.b}</span></dt>
            </div>
          ))}
        </dl>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
          <span>{C.stand}: {TECH_DATENSTAND[lang]}</span>
          <span>{C.version} {TECH_VERSION}</span>
          <span>{C.autor}: <a href={authorHref} rel="author" class="font-medium text-foreground hover:text-cta">{AUTOR.name}</a></span>
          <span>{C.pub} <time datetime={TECH_PUBLISHED.toISOString()}>{fmtDate(TECH_PUBLISHED)}</time> · {C.upd} <time datetime={TECH_UPDATED.toISOString()}>{fmtDate(TECH_UPDATED)}</time></span>
          <a href="#methodik" class="font-medium text-cta-accessible transition-colors hover:text-cta">{C.jump[0]}</a>
          <a href="#limitationen" class="font-medium text-cta-accessible transition-colors hover:text-cta">{C.jump[1]}</a>
          <a href="#zitieren" class="font-medium text-cta-accessible transition-colors hover:text-cta">{C.jump[2]}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Zentrale Befunde: Segmentvergleich + drei Karten ── -->
    <section aria-labelledby="h-befunde" class="border-b border-border bg-background">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-8">
        <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cta-accessible">{C.befundeKicker}</p>
        <h2 id="h-befunde" class="cai-h2 text-foreground">{C.befundeH2}</h2>
        <figure class="tx-seg mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 sm:p-8">
          <figcaption>
            <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">{C.segTitle}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">{C.segSub}</p>
          </figcaption>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-5">
            {SEGMENTE.map((s) => (
              <li class="tx-row">
                <div><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">{de ? s.de : s.en}</span> <span class="whitespace-nowrap text-sm text-muted-foreground">· {s.firmen} {C.firmen}</span></div>
                <div class="tx-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class:list={['tx-bar', { 'tx-hot': s.key === 'systemhaus' }]} style={`--w:${s.quote}%`}></span></div>
                <div><span class="text-xl font-bold tabular-nums text-foreground">{pc(s.quote, 0)}</span> <span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">{C.nie(s.nie, s.firmen)}</span></div>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </figure>
        <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
          {C.cards.map((c) => (
            <article class="tx-card flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-8">
              <span class="text-5xl font-bold tabular-nums tracking-tight text-foreground">{c.n}</span>
              <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-foreground">{c.t}</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">{c.d}</p>
              <p class="tx-base mt-6 pt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">{C.basis}: {c.b}</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Inhalt + TOC ── -->
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[220px_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-16">
        <aside class="hidden lg:block">
          <nav aria-label={C.toc} class="sticky top-28 py-16 text-sm">
            <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground">{C.toc}</p>
            <ol class="space-y-3 border-l border-border">
              {C.tocItems.map(([id, label]) => (
                <li><a href={`#${id}`} class="-ml-px block border-l-2 border-transparent pl-4 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-cta hover:text-foreground">{label}</a></li>
              ))}
            </ol>
          </nav>
        </aside>

        <div class="min-w-0">

          <section id="zusammenfassung" aria-labelledby="h-zusammenfassung" class="scroll-mt-28 py-16">
            <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cta-accessible">{C.absKicker}</p>
            <h2 id="h-zusammenfassung" class="cai-h2 text-foreground">{C.absH2}</h2>
            <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-cta bg-muted/30 p-8">
              <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground">{C.abs1}</p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground">
                {C.abs2.map((part, i) => (i % 2 === 1 ? <strong>{part}</strong> : part))}
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section id="ergebnisse" aria-labelledby="h-ergebnisse" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-border py-16">
            <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cta-accessible">{C.resKicker}</p>
            <h2 id="h-ergebnisse" class="cai-h2 text-foreground">{C.resH2}</h2>
            <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
              {C.res.map((r) => (
                <article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-8">
                  <span class="text-5xl font-bold tabular-nums tracking-tight text-foreground">{r.n}</span>
                  <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">{r.t}</h3>
                  <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">{r.d}</p>
                  <div class="mt-6 h-2 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-muted" aria-hidden="true"><div class="h-full rounded-full tx-navy" style={`width:${r.w}%`}></div></div>
                </article>
              ))}
            </div>
            <p class="mt-6 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">{C.resNote}</p>
          </section>

          <section id="systeme" aria-labelledby="h-systeme" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-border py-16">
            <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cta-accessible">{C.sysKicker}</p>
            <h2 id="h-systeme" class="cai-h2 text-foreground">{C.sysH2}</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">{C.sysLead}</p>
            <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card">
              <table class="w-full min-w-[560px] text-sm">
                <thead><tr class="border-b border-border text-left text-muted-foreground">{C.sysHead.map((h, i) => <th scope="col" class={`px-5 py-3 font-semibold ${i ? 'text-right' : ''}`}>{h}</th>)}</tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  {SYSTEME.map((s) => (
                    <tr class="border-b border-border last:border-0">
                      <th scope="row" class="px-5 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-foreground">{!de && s.nameEn ? s.nameEn : s.name}</th>
                      <td class="px-5 py-3 text-right tabular-nums">{pc0(s.software)}</td>
                      <td class="px-5 py-3 text-right tabular-nums">{pc0(s.systemhaus)}</td>
                      <td class="px-5 py-3 text-right tabular-nums">{s.security === null ? '—' : pc0(s.security)}</td>
                      <td class="px-5 py-3 text-right font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">{pc(s.gesamt)}</td>
                    </tr>
                  ))}
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground">{C.sysNote}</p>
          </section>

          <section id="vergleich" aria-labelledby="h-vergleich" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-border py-16">
            <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cta-accessible">{C.vglKicker}</p>
            <h2 id="h-vergleich" class="cai-h2 text-foreground">{C.vglH2}</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">{C.vglLead}</p>
            <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card">
              <table class="w-full min-w-[680px] text-sm">
                <thead><tr class="border-b border-border text-left text-muted-foreground">{C.vglHead.map((h, i) => <th scope="col" class={`px-4 py-3 font-semibold ${i ? 'text-right' : ''}`}>{h}</th>)}</tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  {VERGLEICH.map((v) => (
                    <tr class="border-b border-border last:border-0">
                      <th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-foreground">{de ? v.de : v.en}</th>
                      <td class="px-4 py-3 text-right tabular-nums text-muted-foreground">{vgl(v.mittelstand)}</td>
                      <td class="px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">{vgl(v.it)}</td>
                      <td class="px-4 py-3 text-right tabular-nums">{vgl(v.software)}</td>
                      <td class="px-4 py-3 text-right font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">{vgl(v.systemhaus)}</td>
                      <td class="px-4 py-3 text-right tabular-nums">{vgl(v.security)}</td>
                    </tr>
                  ))}
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">{C.vglNote}</p>
            <a href={mittelstandHref} class="mt-5 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-cta-accessible hover:text-cta">{C.vglLink}</a>
          </section>

          <section id="wettbewerber" aria-labelledby="h-wettbewerber" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-border py-16">
            <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cta-accessible">{C.wbKicker}</p>
            <h2 id="h-wettbewerber" class="cai-h2 text-foreground">{C.wbH2}</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">{C.wbLead}</p>
            <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 sm:p-8">
              <p class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><span><i class="tx-key tx-navy"></i>{C.wbLegend[0]}</span><span><i class="tx-key tx-light"></i>{C.wbLegend[1]}</span></p>
              <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4">
                {[{ l: C.wbAll, m: T.mittelstaendler }, ...SEGMENTE.map((s) => ({ l: de ? s.de : s.en, m: s.mittelstaendler }))].map((r) => (
                  <li class="tx-stack-row">
                    <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">{r.l}</span>
                    <div class="tx-stack" role="img" aria-label={`${r.l}: ${pc0(r.m)} ${C.wbLegend[0]}, ${pc0(100 - r.m)} ${C.wbLegend[1]}`}>
                      <span class="tx-navy" style={`width:${r.m}%`}>{pc0(r.m)}</span>
                      <span class="tx-light" style={`width:${100 - r.m}%`}>{pc0(100 - r.m)}</span>
                    </div>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section id="quellen" aria-labelledby="h-quellen" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-border py-16">
            <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cta-accessible">{C.qKicker}</p>
            <h2 id="h-quellen" class="cai-h2 text-foreground">{C.qH2}</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">{C.qLead}</p>
            <div class="mt-8 space-y-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 sm:p-8">
              {QUELLEN.map((q) => (
                <div class="tx-q">
                  <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">{de ? q.de : q.en}</span>
                  <div class="tx-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tx-bar" style={`--w:${q.anteil}%`}></span></div>
                  <span class="text-sm font-bold tabular-nums text-foreground">{q.anteil >= 10 ? `${C.qRund} ` : ''}{pc0(q.anteil)}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
            <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-foreground">{C.qPointe}</p>
          </section>

          <section id="faelle" aria-labelledby="h-faelle" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-border py-16">
            <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cta-accessible">{C.fKicker}</p>
            <h2 id="h-faelle" class="cai-h2 text-foreground">{C.fH2}</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">{C.fLead}</p>
            <div class="mt-10 space-y-4">
              {C.faelle.map((f) => (
                <details class="cai-acc group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card open:border-cta/40 open:shadow-sm">
                  <summary class="cai-acc-head flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
                    <div>
                      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cta-accessible">{f.k}</p>
                      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">{f.s}</p>
                    </div>
                    <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
                  </summary>
                  <p class="border-t border-border px-6 py-6 leading-relaxed text-foreground">{f.d}</p>
                </details>
              ))}
            </div>
          </section>

          <section id="grafiken" aria-labelledby="h-grafiken" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-border py-16">
            <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cta-accessible">{C.gKicker}</p>
            <h2 id="h-grafiken" class="cai-h2 text-foreground">{C.gH2}</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-muted-foreground">{C.gLead}</p>
            <img src={`${base}${TECH_GRAFIKEN}Grafik-1_Nennung-je-Segment.png`} alt={C.gAlt} width="3200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="mt-8 w-full rounded-2xl border border-border" />
            <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
              {C.grafiken.map(([file, label]) => (
                <li class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
                  <p class="font-semibold text-foreground">{label}</p>
                  <p class="mt-2 flex gap-4 text-sm">
                    <a href={`${base}${TECH_GRAFIKEN}${file}.png`} download class="font-semibold text-cta-accessible hover:text-cta">PNG ↓</a>
                    <a href={`${base}${TECH_GRAFIKEN}${file}.pdf`} download class="font-semibold text-cta-accessible hover:text-cta">PDF ↓</a>
                  </p>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section id="domain-check" aria-labelledby="h-domain-check" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-border py-16">
            <div data-theme="dark" class="rounded-3xl bg-background p-8 text-foreground sm:p-12">
              <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cta">{C.dcKicker}</p>
              <h2 id="h-domain-check" class="cai-h2">{C.dcH2}</h2>
              <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-ondark-muted">{C.dcLead}</p>
